<title>UK: Genfinance adds 1.0 bln Lux francs to 10-yr bond.</title>
<headline>Genfinance adds 1.0 bln Lux francs to 10-yr bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond has been increased to 3.0 billion Luxembourg francs from 2.0 billion francs, joint lead managers BGL and Generale Bank said.</p>
<p> BORROWER   GENFINANCE LUX SA</p>
<p>GUARANTOR  GENERALE BANK</p>
<p> AMT    3.0 BLN FLUX  COUPON     6.00	MATURITY    10.APR.07</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.90    PAY DATE    10.APR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.0	 LISTING    LUX	 GOV LAW     LUX</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  =	   DENOMS (K) 50-250    SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> NOTES	ORIGINALLY LAUNCHED ON 06.MAR.97</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
